ten_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160046409", "author": {"steamid": "76561199178330004", "personaname": "jdrennen01", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199178330004/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1861, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1861, "last_played": 1709757531, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "I was enjoying the game up until the last section and final boss. The final bosses 2nd phase becomes a confusing mess that was not fun to play and I don't look forward to replaying the boss in future re-rolls. \n\nMore importantly the enemy/weapon scaling is entirely pointless and had I known about the issue I would have not bought the game. Enemies increase in level as you progress your archetype and weapons, so you never truly get better gear. This also has an effect on your other weapons, making it unfun to try different weapons without completely unleveling the rest of your gear. I will not be playing this game nor purchase the DLCs until I hear news that this issue is fixed. \n\nMaking so that upgrades dont do a flat damage bonus but adds increased crit chance, health modifiers, etc. would be a fun way to give additional builds/strategies without scaling the world to your highest weapons/archetypes.", "timestamp_created": 1709829275, "timestamp_updated": 1709829275, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.508928596973419189", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160030258", "author": {"steamid": "76561199032806794", "personaname": "Liliana96", "persona_status": "offline", "prof